WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.089
Loop X two point zero. A workbench for
long-horizon research.

2
00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.189
Carry the goal, constraints, and return
route.

3
00:00:10.369 --> 00:00:12.440
Let the existing owner adopt the work.

4
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.602
Keep corrections on the task. Return the
evidence.

5
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.287
See work, waiting decisions, and schedules.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.374
A claim applies only to its tested
condition.

7
00:00:25.554 --> 00:00:28.443
Check the control. Keep unknown benefits
unknown.

8
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:33.049
This probe improved. The native score is not
established.

9
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.295
Pause here. Reread the headline, or inspect
the control?

10
00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.570
Repeating the headline adds no recorded
evidence here.

11
00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:50.174
The control keeps accuracy unchanged, with
thirty two percent more time.

12
00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:55.659
Both paths use the same record. Native
benefit remains unknown.

13
00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.677
Keep the question, the evidence, and your
next decision.

14
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:05.546
Read six process judgments. Keep unknowns
visible.

15
00:01:05.726 --> 00:01:09.372
Trace claims to their source. Measure
results and costs separately.

16
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.933
Choose a matched test. Record its result and
cost.

17
00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:19.830
Keep the next step with its evidence.

18
00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:25.833
Loop X. Keep the research, evidence, and
next decision together.
